   "text": "Hult International Business School - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nHult International Business School\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nAt Hult, we believe that education is about so much more than a degree. It’s about transformation. Students want skills that will transform their lives. Employers want graduates that will transform their businesses. Society wants businesses that will transform the world. Like all change, it starts with action.\nBy focusing on what our students can do in the real world, rather than just the theory they study in classrooms, we prioritize those skills and mindsets that are most needed to bring about change—in the careers of the individual, the businesses they work in, and the society we all live in. This belief in the power of learning by doing goes beyond a philosophy; it is the guiding force behind every program we provide, every course we create, every class we run. It’s what makes Hult the business school for those made to do.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:30\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:30\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$87,900.00\nMin: US$36,855.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n50%\n1,400 of 2,800 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1964\nCampus(es)\nBoston, London, Dubai\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nUnited States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.hult.edu/housing/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.hult.edu/masters/admissions/scholarships/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QyeO96VSItI\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.hult.edu/masters/international-business/internship/\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee: $95",
